{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1300,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "# Gemma 4 12B Unified — model  \nRead top → bottom. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all one size; where parameters and compute live is the pair of bars above. T = sequence length, P = image patches, A = audio frames. *Layer* tab = one decoder layer in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1300,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "**Dense** decoder, 48 layers, pattern [5 sliding, 1 full] ×8.    \n**Grey rows** — sliding window 1024, GQA 16 q / 8 kv × 256, RoPE θ 10,000 · **Cyan rows** — full causal attention, 16 q / **1 kv** × 512 with **K = V** (one projection), p-RoPE θ 1,000,000 on 128 of 512 dims.    \n**Encoder-free**: image patches (violet) and audio frames (pink) enter through one linear layer each — no ViT, no conformer."
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -1040,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**raw text**  \"The cat sat…\"  \nwith image / audio placeholders",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "tok2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -928,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**tokenizer** (vocab 262,144)",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "ids3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 130,
   "y": -832,
   "width": 40,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 320,
   "y": -842,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`token ids [T] — one integer per token`"
  },
  {
   "id": "embed5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -778,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**embed** — look up row *id*, × √3840  \n1.01B · table 262,144 × 3840",
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "x06",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -4,
   "y": -666,
   "width": 307,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 324,
   "y": -676,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 3840]  (placeholder rows = pad)`"
  },
  {
   "id": "splice8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -612,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**splice** — overwrite every image / video / audio placeholder row with a soft token",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "x9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -4,
   "y": -482,
   "width": 307,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 324,
   "y": -492,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 3840]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "img11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -630,
   "y": -1040,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**image** (or video frame) — resized so it  \nfits ≤ 280 tokens (70 per video frame)",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "pm12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -630,
   "y": -928,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**patchify** 16px, then **merge** 3×3  \n→ one 48×48 RGB patch per token",
   "color": "#a78bfa"
  },
  {
   "id": "vp13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -756,
   "y": -816,
   "width": 553,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1216,
   "y": -826,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`raw pixels [P, 6912]  (48×48×3)`"
  },
  {
   "id": "pd15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -630,
   "y": -762,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**LayerNorm → Linear** 6912 → 3840  \n**→ LayerNorm**  \n26.6M",
   "color": "#a78bfa"
  },
  {
   "id": "vf016",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -634,
   "y": -632,
   "width": 307,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1094,
   "y": -642,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`[P, 3840]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "pos18",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -630,
   "y": -578,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**+ 2D pos**: row x + row y of a  \n1120×2×3840 table → LayerNorm  \n8.6M",
   "color": "#a78bfa"
  },
  {
   "id": "vf119",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -634,
   "y": -448,
   "width": 307,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
