  },
  {
   "id": "note-tick47",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1892,
   "y": -298,
   "width": 60,
   "height": 30,
   "text": "L47"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-unified",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -720,
   "y": -190,
   "width": 540,
   "height": 300,
   "text": "**What \"unified\" means.** Other Gemma 4 models run images through a ViT (~550M on 31B) and audio through a conformer (~300M on E2B/E4B) before the LLM. This one has **no encoder at all**: a 48×48 patch or a 40 ms frame is normalised and hit with one matrix (49.9M vision, 2.5M audio in total), so all perception happens inside the same 48 decoder layers that read text — and one fine-tune trains everything."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-mask",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -720,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 540,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "**Mask.** Text is causal. Tokens of one image / video frame see each other **bidirectionally**, but only in the 40 sliding layers; the 8 full layers stay causal everywhere (use_bidirectional_attention = \"vision\"). Audio tokens are causal."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-pattern",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -720,
   "y": 370,
   "width": 540,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "**Layer pattern** — 40 sliding + 8 full (every 6th, and the last).  \nKV cache per token: sliding 4,096 values but only for the last 1024 tokens; full 1,024 values (one 512-wide head, K and V from the same projection) for the whole context — so a full layer costs 4× less cache per token than a sliding one would."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-layer",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -720,
   "y": 660,
   "width": 540,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "**One layer** — sliding 224.1M, full 241.8M; the GELU-tanh MLP 3840→15360→3840 is 176.9M of it. Sandwich RMSNorms (before *and* after each sub-block), qk-norm instead of 1/√d scaling, and a learned per-layer output scalar."
  },
  {
   "id": "ho31",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -4,
   "y": 950,
   "width": 307,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl32",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 324,
   "y": 940,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`h [T, 3840]  after L47`"
  },
  {
   "id": "fn33",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1004,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**final RMSNorm**",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "xf34",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -4,
   "y": 1100,
   "width": 307,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl35",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 324,
   "y": 1090,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 3840]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "head36",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1154,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**lm head** 3840 → 262,144  \n= embed table, transposed (tied)",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "logits37",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -550,
   "y": 1266,
   "width": 1400,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl38",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 870,
   "y": 1256,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`logits [T, 262144]` — bar clipped (real 20972px)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap39",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1320,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**softcap** 30·tanh(z / 30)",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "samp40",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1416,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**softmax → sample**",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "next41",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1512,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**next token id**",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dcat42",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1243,
   "y": 892,
   "width": 614,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl43",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1877,
   "y": 882,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`embed(last token) ‖ h  [1, 7680]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-tap46",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 410,
   "y": 41,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "↳ L46 K,V (last sliding) → drafter"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-tap47",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 410,
   "y": 123,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "↳ L47 K,V + last hidden h → drafter"
  },
  {
   "id": "dpre44",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1400,
   "y": 946,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**pre_projection** 7680 → 1024  \n7.9M",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dh45",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1509,
   "y": 1042,
   "width": 82,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl46",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 1032,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`[1, 1024]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "dblk47",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1400,
   "y": 1096,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**4 drafter layers** (3 sliding + 1 full)  \n**Q-only** attention onto the target's K,V · GELU MLP 8192  \n142.6M · incl. norms",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dhead48",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1400,
   "y": 1226,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**own lm head** 1024 → 262,144 (tied)  \n268.4M",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dids49",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1530,
   "y": 1338,
   "width": 40,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl50",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 1328,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`draft token id`"
  },
  {
   "id": "dpost51",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1400,
   "y": 1392,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "**post_projection** 1024 → 3840  \n= next h; loop for the next draft  \n3.9M",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dver52",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1400,
   "y": 1522,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**verify**: main model checks all  \ndrafts in one forward pass",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-mtp",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1400,
   "y": 1624,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "MTP drafter, shipped as a separate repo (google/gemma-4-12B-it-assistant, 422.9M). It has **no K/V weights**: all 4 layers attend to the target's cached K,V of L46 / L47. Input = target embed of the last token ‖ target hidden h; each step drafts one token and feeds post_projection(out) back as h. Not counted in the budget bars."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bpt",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1746,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 40,
   "text": "**Where the parameters are stored (one BF16 safetensors file)** — total 11.96B"
  },
  {
   "id": "bp0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1700,
   "width": 1846,
   "height": 44,
   "text": "**GELU MLP ×48**",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "bp1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 946,
   "y": -1700,
   "width": 411,
   "height": 44,
   "text": "**sliding attention ×40**",
   "color": "#94a3b8"
  },
  {
   "id": "bp2",
