  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bpl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1650,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "GELU MLP ×48 **8.49B** (71.0%) · sliding attention ×40 **1.89B** (15.8%) · full attention ×8 **519.0M** (4.3%) · embed **1.01B** (8.4%) · lm head **0** (tied: the embed table, stored once) · vision embedder **49.9M** (0.4%) · audio embedder **2.5M** (<0.1%) · norms + layer scalars **0.8M** (<0.1%)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bct",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1546,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 40,
   "text": "**What one text token is multiplied by — dense, so every layer weight; the lookup and the per-image / per-clip embedders drop out** — total 11.91B"
  },
  {
   "id": "bc0",
